### Gradle ###
.gradle
build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### Benchmark artefacts ###
# Raw run output: one JSON, two metric scrapes, a JFR recording and a log per
# cell, and the full matrix is several hundred cells. Analysis written from it
# belongs in results/analysis/ and is committed.
results/raw/*
!results/raw/.gitkeep
results/*.log
# Flight recordings, including ones written to the repo root by the
# -XX:StartFlightRecording example in docs/RUNNING.md
*.jfr
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

### Terraform ###
# State can contain instance addresses and any secret passed as a variable;
# tfvars routinely holds credentials. Neither belongs in a shared repo.
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.lock.hcl

